	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16862"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=236" title="View the profile of Carsonn">Carsonn</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 127<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/demon1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I&#039;m a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=236"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16862#msg16862"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16862#msg16862">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2896 on:</b> May 04, 2005, 11:54:15 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16858#msg16858">Quote from: Frofro on May 04, 2005, 11:41:09 am</a></div><div class="quote"><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">First you still haven&#039;t answered the questions I asked.  I&#039;m not talking about CoHing past Hegemony in VT that normal and should have been expected since UoP knew they didn&#039;t.  That&#039;s not Cockblocking thats UoP having a 2 hour head start.  But all the other things that they have done warrants them to have that rep.  Your members threw a fit and said they never did that kinda thing and it&#039;s bs and then they ask for examples.  I gave you some and you throw a hissy about that and still claim to be innocent.  <br /></div><br />No, I&#039;m not going to answer you question! <br />1 i wasn&#039;t apart of the guild when that crap happened.<br />2 most of our current members were not apart of the guild when that happened.<br />3 we are under new leadership.<br />4 I&#039;m more concerned with events that have happened in the last week than crap that has been beet to death 2 years ago. <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/banghead2.gif" alt="banghead2" border="0" /><br /></div><br />Your not under new leadership.  your leader was an officer then and you have a few officers that were officers then.  Half the guild was around when that happened.  so 2 and 3 are BS 4 is a mute point becuase you complain about it and claim innocent and your not.<br /><br />You wont answer my questions becuase you know i&#039;m right.  If I said you did something you didn&#039;t do you would be all over me calling BS and calling me a lair.  In this case every example is dead on and therefor you try to play it off as some crap that isnt worth mentioning.  You asked for examples and you got them.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
