							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">If I said you did something you didn&#039;t do you would be all over me calling BS and calling me a lair.</div><br />Well then Sir, I&#039;m calling BS and you are a Liar!<br /><br />I have never blocked anyone from progression! and i refuse to comment on something that happened years ago when i was inactive.<br /><br />edit to fix quote tag
