							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16862#msg16862">Quote from: Carsonn on May 04, 2005, 11:54:15 am</a></div><div class="quote"><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16858#msg16858">Quote from: Frofro on May 04, 2005, 11:41:09 am</a></div><div class="quote"><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">First you still haven&#039;t answered the questions I asked.  I&#039;m not talking about CoHing past Hegemony in VT that normal and should have been expected since UoP knew they didn&#039;t.  That&#039;s not Cockblocking thats UoP having a 2 hour head start.  But all the other things that they have done warrants them to have that rep.  Your members threw a fit and said they never did that kinda thing and it&#039;s bs and then they ask for examples.  I gave you some and you throw a hissy about that and still claim to be innocent.  <br /></div><br />No, I&#039;m not going to answer you question! <br />1 i wasn&#039;t apart of the guild when that crap happened.<br />2 most of our current members were not apart of the guild when that happened.<br />3 we are under new leadership.<br />4 I&#039;m more concerned with events that have happened in the last week than crap that has been beet to death 2 years ago. <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/banghead2.gif" alt="banghead2" border="0" /><br /></div><br />Your not under new leadership.  your leader was an officer then and you have a few officers that were officers then.  Half the guild was around when that happened.  so 2 and 3 are BS 4 is a mute point becuase you complain about it and claim innocent and your not.<br /><br />You wont answer my questions becuase you know i&#039;m right.  If I said you did something you didn&#039;t do you would be all over me calling BS and calling me a lair.  In this case every example is dead on and therefor you try to play it off as some crap that isnt worth mentioning.  You asked for examples and you got them.<br /></div><br />actually(sp) i dont knwo where you get off saying 2 is BS we lost members for RoS DA/EiE and got ALOt of new members when JH/TA broke down we have alot of diffrent people now that played a year or 2 ago
